From abc6d403a9b1b9166b56fce9f6e229de877f64fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian <julian.novosad1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Nov 2025 15:30:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: Remove obsolete ImageResizer module

Removes the 'image_resizer.h' include from main.cpp and the corresponding
'image_resizer.cpp' source file from the CMakeLists.txt build target.

This module was made obsolete by the change to request correctly-sized
frames directly from the camera's ISP. The source files were deleted
in a 'git clean' operation, and this commit removes the final remaining
references to them, fixing the build.
---
 CMakeLists.txt |  38 ++++++----
 src/main.cpp   | 184 +++++++++++++++----------------------------------
 2 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 142 deletions(-)

